"campaign":"16V244000","received":"2016-04-26","manufacturer":"Nissan North America, Inc.","component":"AIR BAGS:SENSOR:OCCUPANT CLASSIFICATION","summary":"Nissan North America, Inc. (Nissan) is recalling certain model year 2016-2017 Nissan Maxima, 2013-2016 Nissan Altima, NV200, LEAF, Sentra, and Pathfinder, 2014-2016 Nissan NV200 Taxi, Infiniti QX60, QX60 Hybrid, and Q50 Hybrid, 2014-2017 Nissan Rogue and Infiniti Q50, 2015-2016 Nissan Murano, Murano Hybrid, and Chevrolet City Express, 2014-2015 Nissan Pathfinder Hybrid, and 2013 Infiniti JX35 vehicles.  In these vehicles, the front seat passenger Occupant Classification System (OCS) may incorrectly classify an adult passenger as a child or classify the seat as empty despite it being occupied.  As a result, the passenger frontal air bag may be turned off and not deploy in the event of a crash.","consequence":"If the passenger frontal air bag does not deploy as intended in the event of a crash, the passenger is at an increased risk of injury.","remedy":"Nissan will notify their owners.  Chevrolet City Express owners will be notified by General Motors.  Dealers will reprogram the Air Bag Control Unit (ACU) and OCS Electronic Control Unit (ECU) in Altima, Maxima, Murano, Rogue, and Sentra vehicles, and replace the OCS ECU in LEAF, NV200, NV200 Taxi, Pathfinder, Infiniti Q50, JX35, and QX60 and Chevrolet City Express vehicles, free of charge.  Interim notices were sent to owners on May 31, 2016.  Owners will receive a second notice when remedy parts become available.  Owners may contact Nissan customer service at 1-800-867-7669, Infiniti customer service at 1-888-833-3216 or Chevrolet customer service at 1-800-222-1020.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":3296947,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=16V244000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":51,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2013","make":"NISSAN","model":"LEAF"},{"year":"2013","make":"NISSAN","model":"SENTRA"},{"year":"2013","make":"INFINITI","model":"JX35"},{"year":"2014","make":"NISSAN","model":"ALTIMA"},{"year":"2014","make":"INFINITI","model":"Q50"},{"year":"2013","make":"NISSAN","model":"NV200"},{"year":"2013","make":"NISSAN","model":"PATHFINDER"},{"year":"2013","make":"NISSAN","model":"ALTIMA"},{"year":"2014","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2015","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2014","make":"INFINITI","model":"Q50 HYBRID"},{"year":"2014","make":"INFINITI","model":"QX60 HYBRID"},{"year":"2014","make":"NISSAN","model":"LEAF"},{"year":"2014","make":"NISSAN","model":"PATHFINDER HYBRID"},{"year":"2014","make":"NISSAN","model":"SENTRA"},{"year":"2014","make":"INFINITI","model":"QX60"},{"year":"2014","make":"NISSAN","model":"PATHFINDER"},{"year":"2015","make":"NISSAN","model":"PATHFINDER"},{"year":"2015","make":"INFINITI","model":"Q50"},{"year":"2016","make":"INFINITI","model":"QX60"},{"year":"2016","make":"NISSAN","model":"MURANO"},{"year":"2016","make":"NISSAN","model":"PATHFINDER"},{"year":"2017","make":"NISSAN","model":"MAXIMA"},{"year":"2015","make":"NISSAN","model":"MURANO"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":true},{"campaign":"22V420000","received":"2022-06-13","manufacturer":"Nissan North America, Inc.","component":"LATCHES/LOCKS/LINKAGES:HOOD:LATCH","summary":"Nissan North America, Inc. (Nissan) is recalling certain 2013-2016 Pathfinder vehicles.  On certain Pathfinder vehicles, the secondary hood latch may malfunction and remain in the unlatched, unsecured, position when the hood is closed.","consequence":"An unsecured hood could unexpectedly open while driving, obstructing the driver's view, and increasing the risk of a crash.","remedy":"Dealers will replace the bell crank assembly, free of charge.  Owner letters were mailed March 26, 2025.  Owners may contact Nissan's customer service at 1-800-867-7669.  Nissan's number for this recall are R22A2 R22A3 and R24B7.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":322671,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=22V420000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":4,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2016","make":"NISSAN","model":"PATHFINDER"},{"year":"2013","make":"NISSAN","model":"PATHFINDER"},{"year":"2015","make":"NISSAN","model":"PATHFINDER"},{"year":"2014","make":"NISSAN","model":"PATHFINDER"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false}]}
